253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 167 0 R
/T (Abstract  Legacy Loop is a centralized academic ecosystem designed specifically for university students to improve peer-to-peer learning, resource sharing, and academic collaboration. Students often face difficulties accessing affordable study materials, verified mentorship, and organized academic discussions, as most interactions are scattered across informal social media groups. Legacy Loop addresses these challenges by providing a unified mobile platform where students can exchange academic resources, connect with mentors, participate in course-specific discussions, and utilize AI- powered academic assistance. )
/E (Abstract  Legacy Loop is a centralized academic ecosystem designed specifically for university students to improve peer-to-peer learning, resource sharing, and academic collaboration. Students often face difficulties accessing affordable study materials, verified mentorship, and organized academic discussions, as most interactions are scattered across informal social media groups. Legacy Loop addresses these challenges by providing a unified mobile platform where students can exchange academic resources, connect with mentors, participate in course-specific discussions, and utilize AI- powered academic assistance. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 167 0 R
/T (The platform integrates multiple modules including an ad-based marketplace for books and notes, a mentorship advertising hub, a tag-based academic forum, an AI chatbot, and a quiz & assignment generator. The AI modules utilize structured academic datasets derived from past papers and course materials to provide syllabus-aligned support and generate exam-oriented practice content. )
/E (The platform integrates multiple modules including an ad-based marketplace for books and notes, a mentorship advertising hub, a tag-based academic forum, an AI chatbot, and a quiz & assignment generator. The AI modules utilize structured academic datasets derived from past papers and course materials to provide syllabus-aligned support and generate exam-oriented practice content. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 167 0 R
/T (Developed using React Native, ASP.NET Core, MongoDB Atlas, and SignalR, Legacy Loop formalizes campus academic interactions into a scalable mobile application. The platform aims to reduce educational costs, preserve institutional knowledge, improve exam preparation, and create a sustainable peer-learning environment where knowledge and resources are continuously shared between senior and junior students. )
/E (Developed using React Native, ASP.NET Core, MongoDB Atlas, and SignalR, Legacy Loop formalizes campus academic interactions into a scalable mobile application. The platform aims to reduce educational costs, preserve institutional knowledge, improve exam preparation, and create a sustainable peer-learning environment where knowledge and resources are continuously shared between senior and junior students. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
