/Title (Abstract  Legacy Loop is a centralized academic ecosystem designed specifically for university students to improve peer-to-peer learning, resource sharing, and academic collaboration. Students often face difficulties accessing affordable study materials, verified mentorship, and organized academic discussions, as most interactions are scattered across informal social media groups. Legacy Loop addresses these challenges by providing a unified mobile platform where students can exchange academic resources, connect with mentors, participate in course-specific discussions, and utilize AI- powered academic assistance.)
