<<
/Title (Universitystudentsfrequently face difficulties in accessing affordable study materials, verified mentorship,andorganized academic discussions. Most academic interactions currently take place throughscatteredsocial media platforms such as WhatsApp and Facebook groups where information becomesdifficulttomanage, search, or preserve. Important academic resources such as textbooks, handwrittennotes,and senior guidance are often lost after student's graduate, creating a gap between seniorandjuniorstudents.  LegacyLoopisdesigned to solve this problem by creating a centralized academic ecosystem specificallytailoredfor university students. The platform provides a structured environment where studentscanexchange academic resources, connect with mentors, participate in course-specific discussions,andutilize AI-powered study assistance tools. By integrating all these features into a singlemobileapplication, the system aims to improve academic collaboration and reduce dependencyonfragmented communication channels.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2160 0 R
/Next 2176 0 R
>>
